        desc = "MISC_CTRL9 is MISC register 9.

DS inconsistency: the bit row of the data sheet gives resets that do not match the header; the header total reset 0x123 is modelled (s1 = 3, s2 = 2, s3 = 1, s4 = 0).

Data sheet 3.5.5.2 MISC_CTRL9 (offset 0x24, printed page 3-67, `hi3518ev200-datasheet.txt` line 25869).";

