    reg {
        name = "MISC register 14";
        desc = "MISC_CTRL14 is MISC register 14.

DS inconsistency: header total reset 0x1 (port1 = 1, port2 = 0, as modelled) vs bit row (port2 = 2, port1 = 3). The text says value 1 is the highest priority. Needs a hardware read.

Data sheet 3.5.5.2 MISC_CTRL14 (offset 0x38, printed page 3-69, `hi3518ev200-datasheet.txt` line 25975).";

        field {
            name = "media0axi_port2_pri";
