Vendor use: acodec.ko (Hi3518EV200_MPP_V1.0.5.0, OpenIPC kmod copy, static analysis only) ioremaps 0x201200C4..0x201200E3 as one block (this register is word 5 of it) and its soft-reset routine (also run at module load) writes 0x1E1EC001 here: ADC left/right volume code 0x1E, both HPF enabled (bits 15:14), adcr_lrsel = 1. At load it first clears bit 15 of PERI_CRG35 (0x2003008C), then steps MISC_CTRL50 through 0xFCCC0000, 0xFCFC0000, 0xF8FC0000 (vref powered up last) before the soft-reset writes.

Data sheet 3.5.5.2 MISC_CTRL54 (offset 0xD8, printed page 3-85, `hi3518ev200-datasheet.txt` line 26827).";

